        <mxCell id="15" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color='#065F46'&gt;Focused 25-Stock Universe &amp; Features&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Top 5 Performing ETFs: SMH, SOXX, XLK, SPMO, QQQ&lt;br/&gt;• 25 Market Leaders: NVDA, AAPL, MSFT, AVGO, TSLA...&lt;br/&gt;• 16-Factor Momentum, Realized Vol, &amp; Relative Panel&lt;br/&gt;• Walk-Forward Tested (2022–2026): 60.59% CAGR, 1.36 Sh" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#34D399;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1E293B;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontSize=11;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
