        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="17" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color='#065F46'&gt;ML Export Resolution &amp; Freshness&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;1. Priority: data/xgb_focused_current_scores.csv&lt;br/&gt;2. Fallback: data/xgb_current_scores_1m.csv (S&amp;P 500)&lt;br/&gt;3. Freshness Gate: Scores &gt; 7 days old are discarded&lt;br/&gt;4. Out-of-Scope Fallback: in_scope=False, score=50.0&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color='#047857'&gt;ml_weight automatically set to 0.0% for out-of-scope&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#34D399;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1E293B;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontSize=11;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
