        <mxCell id="39" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color='#C2410C'&gt;Gate 5: Confidence&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mechanistic Calculation:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Decisiveness:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  |Composite - 50| / 50&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Pillar Agreement:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  Dispersion (Std Dev)&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Data Completeness:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  % inputs valid &amp; fresh&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#C2410C'&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOT INVENTED BY LLM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#FDBA74;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1E293B;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontSize=10.5;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
