        <mxCell id="42" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style='font-size: 13px;' color='#065F46'&gt;CERTIFIED BUY SIGNAL&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;LLM Proposed BUY + All 5 Gates Cleared&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Composite ≥ 60.0 &amp; Reward:Risk ≥ 1.20&lt;br/&gt;• Stop loss safely outside option noise threshold&lt;br/&gt;• Earnings cleared (&gt; 3 trading sessions)&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Mechanistic Sizing &amp; Target Established&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Persisted to trader.db &amp; Streamlit / Mobile UI" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=2.5;fontColor=#1E293B;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontSize=11;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
