        <mxCell id="43" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style='font-size: 13px;' color='#991B1B'&gt;ALGORITHMIC VETO → FORCE HOLD&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Triggered when ANY Compliance Gate Fails&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Overrides glowing LLM thesis for capital protection&lt;br/&gt;• Value-Trap penalty or Composite &lt; 60.0&lt;br/&gt;• Stop loss sits inside 1-SD option expected move&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Failure Reason Saved in no_trade_reason&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Full audit trail retained in database signal JSON" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#DC2626;strokeWidth=2.5;fontColor=#1E293B;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontSize=11;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
